# Rendered video exports (4K masters; produced by `pnpm generate:video`)
exports/

# Stale SVG exports from the retired `generate:svgs` pipeline (replaced by the live
# in-map PNG/SVG/GeoJSON download menu). Not read at runtime; must not be committed.
static/svgs/

# The next two entries deliberately carry NO trailing slash: a worktree links them in from the
# main checkout and `foo/` matches only a real directory, so
# the slash would leave two symlinks sitting in `git status` in every worktree. Don't add it back.

# Off-repo GeoJSON data (~1 GB now, scaling to many GB). Served from data.bikenetkit.org via
# `pnpm deploy:data`; NOT committed. The build enumerates it from src/lib/data/data-files.json
# and fetches it at runtime via PUBLIC_DATA_URL, so a clean clone builds without it.
# See www/DEPLOY_DATA.md. Local dev serves these files directly (PUBLIC_DATA_URL empty).
/data

# Off-repo per-dataset screenshots (~570 MB at ~400 cities). Generated by `pnpm generate:screenshots`,
# served from data.bikenetkit.org/screenshots via `pnpm deploy:data`; NOT committed, same rationale
# as static/data/. Local dev serves them directly (PUBLIC_DATA_URL empty).
/screenshots

# Bespoke Sans (Fontshare, ITF Free Font License). Self-hosting it for this site is permitted, but
# § 01 forbids putting the files on a publicly accessible repository, which this is. Keep your own
# copy here: download BespokeSans_Complete.zip from https://www.fontshare.com/fonts/bespoke-sans
# and unzip it into static/fonts/. `pnpm fonts:check` warns when it is missing, and deploy builds
# (REQUIRE_DISPLAY_FONT=1) refuse to run without it. No trailing slash, so a worktree's symlink to
# the main checkout's copy is ignored too.
/static/fonts/BespokeSans_Complete
